. GP0/1/2/4/3; apply pairs in one SIO register write.\nClear SIO mask0x1F before setting the command mask; preserve all other GPIO.\nD2-D5 are unused. Capacitors remain populated per user preference." (at 25.4 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6d209ddd-ffd8-5349-bac9-d37ee824d6da")) (text "All Q sources return to SWRC_GND, then NT1 to GND. Do not add a series resistor in the shared SWRC_PLUS path.\nAt VGS=2.5V the selected MOSFET adds <=0.048R at 25C datasheet conditions; bench-check completed branch resistance.\nPhone remains context-sensitive (answer/end); Hang Up intentionally selects the user-requested Mic Mute command." (at 25.4 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f57254b5-f818-5666-9182-5d2c4e65e247")) (embedded_fonts no))
